{
    "meta": {
        "title": "2023 Malicious Exploitation of Unitronics PLC's ",
        "authors": [
            "Emma Holt"
        ],
        "orgs": [
            "The MITRE Corporation"
        ],
        "description": "A model of the 2023 exploitation of PLCs used in Water and Wastewater Systems.",
        "article": "In November & December of 2023, IRGC affiliated threat actors the CyberAv3ngers gained access to Unitronics PLC's in water and wastewater systems across the US. Unitronics Vision Series PLC's at the time came with a default password searchable via the user manual. The malicious actors gained access using these valid credentials to PLC's openly connected using the commonly used TCP port 20256 to the public internet.",
